---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { sortGuides, sortPaths, tools } from '../lib/content.mjs';
import { href } from '../lib/site.mjs';
const paths = sortPaths(await getCollection('paths'));
const guides = sortGuides(await getCollection('guides'));
---
<Base>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">身份 × 税务 × 福利 × 长远规划</p><h1>一次填记录，<br />看清哪一把尺子先到线。</h1><p class="lede">PR、入籍、税务、省医保和 OAS 各有自己的“居住”定义。枫居罗盘把它们放在同一张未来五年时间线上，帮你决定先查什么、先做什么。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={href('tools/day-ledger/')}>打开天数总账</a><a class="button secondary" href="#situations">按我的情况找路</a></div></div>
      <div class="compass-card" aria-label="一份记录，五把尺子"><strong>一份出入境记录<br /><span>五把尺子</span><br />一张未来时间线</strong></div>
    </section>
    <section class="warning"><strong>你的日期不会离开浏览器。</strong> 所有计算都在当前页面本地完成。本站不给“你是或不是税务居民”的个案结论，也不自动把有争议的境外例外算进去。</section>
    <section class="section" id="situations"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">先认出自己</p><h2>你现在是哪种情况？</h2></div><p>每张卡都通向完整路线图，不再停在三句框架。</p></div><div class="grid">{paths.map((entry) => <a class="card" href={href(`paths/${entry.data.slug}/`)}><span class="tag">处境路线</span><h3>{entry.data.title}</h3><p>{entry.data.summary}</p><span class="card-cta">打开完整路径 →</span></a>)}</div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">六个本地工具</p><h2>把模糊问题变成可核对的输入</h2></div><a href={href('tools/')}>查看全部工具 →</a></div><div class="grid">{Object.values(tools).map((tool) => <a class="card" href={href(tool.href)}><span class="tag">工具</span><h3>{tool.label}</h3><p>{tool.summary}</p><span class="card-cta">打开工具 →</span></a>)}</div></section>
    <section class="section" id="guides"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">网站摘要，论坛详解</p><h2>专题详解</h2></div><p>先在站里看关键数字与适用时机，再进入完整长文。</p></div><div class="grid">{guides.map((entry) => <a class="card" href={href(`guides/${entry.data.slug}/`)}><span class="tag">专题摘要</span><h3>{entry.data.title}</h3><p>{entry.data.summary}</p><span class="card-cta">看摘要与详解入口 →</span></a>)}</div></section>
  </div>
</Base>
